---
// Annotated Composer: file-aware chat + "attachment truth": the file a user
// attaches becomes a real file in the room, not a phantom reference.
---

<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-lg">
  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-[color:var(--surface)] p-4" style="box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);">
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-line bg-[color:var(--paper)] p-3">
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">Summarize the attached spec and flag open questions.</p>
      <!-- attachment chip: marked real -->
      <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-pill border border-line bg-[color:var(--surface)] px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-ink">
          <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.44 11.05 12 20.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1-7.78-7.78l8.49-8.49a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-8.49 8.49a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-2.12-2.12l7.78-7.78" /></svg>
          spec-v3.pdf
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold" style="color: var(--accent); background: var(--accent-soft)">
            <svg width="9" height="9" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>
            real file
          </span>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-faint">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-pill border border-line px-2 py-0.5">+ attach</span>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-pill border border-line px-2 py-0.5">@ agent</span>
        </div>
        <span class="grid h-7 w-7 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-ink text-paper">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" /></svg>
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-muted">
      <span class="mt-0.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full" style="background: var(--accent)"></span>
      Attachment truth: what you attach becomes a real file in the room: no phantom references, no silently lost context.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
